#. Description of the plugin
#: wp2shell-scanner.php
msgid "Checks whether your site is exposed to — or was broken into through — PHP2Shell (CVE-2026-109618 / CVE-2026-109619, critical bugs in PHP itself) and wp2shell (CVE-2026-63030 / CVE-2026-60137, a WordPress core bug). Looks at your PHP and WordPress versions, webshells, rogue admins, changed files and server logs. Scans only read; one-click fixes (quarantine, removing admin rights) are optional and can be undone. Includes a self-hosted fleet dashboard for many sites, with alerts."
msgstr ""

